      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Which Side Are You On?</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As the war continues to swing in the Hordeâ€™s favour, Elberon has come under military occupation by the Horde. The Mayor of Elberon struggles to navigate the Hordeâ€™s ruthless bureaucracy and the rashness of her rebellion-minded citizens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Takes place during chapters 47-53 of &lt;a href="https://archiveofourown.org/works/50077501/chapters/126454726" rel="nofollow"&gt;They'll Know My Name&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
